{"gar": [{"id": "gar", "headword": "गर्", "headword_slp1": "gar", "fold": "gar", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "capeller-sanskrit-german", "senses": [{"gloss": "1. गर् गुणा॑ति, गृणीते॑ (aicj pass.), गिरति,\n˚ते anrufen, preisen, rühmen;\n verkünden.\nअनु ins Lob einstimmen;\n*beistimmen (Dat.). अभि begrüßen,\npreisen. उप anrufen, loben. प्र besingen,\npreisen. प्रति anrufen, begrüßen, *beistimmen\n(Dat.).", "gloss_language": "de"}, {"gloss": "2. गर् गिर॑ति u. गि॑रति, गिरते, गिलति\n(गृणा॑ति) verschlingen, verschlucken;\np.p. गीर्ण — उद् ausspeien;\n ausstoßen\n(Rede). नि hinunterschlingen. सम् =\nSimpl.", "gloss_language": "de"}, {"gloss": "3. गर् Intens. जागर्ति (जागरति, जाग्रति, ˚ते\nu. जागृमि) wachen, erwachen, aufmerken,\nbedacht sein;\n Partic. जागृव॑स् munter,\neifrig. Caus. जागर॑यति (Aor. अ॑जीगर्)\nerwecken, ermuntern, erregen.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "gara": [{"id": "gara", "headword": "गर", "headword_slp1": "gara", "fold": "gara", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "capeller-sanskrit-german", "senses": [{"gloss": "गर॑ verschlingend (—˚);\n m. Trank, Gift\n(auch n.).", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["गरं", "गरः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["garaM", "garaH"]}], "garala": [{"id": "garala", "headword": "गरल", "headword_slp1": "garala", "fold": "garala", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "capeller-sanskrit-german", "senses": [{"gloss": "गरल n. Gift.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["गरलं", "गरलः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["garalaM", "garalaH"]}], "gariman": [{"id": "gariman", "headword": "गरिमन्", "headword_slp1": "gariman", "fold": "gariman", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "capeller-sanskrit-german", "senses": [{"gloss": "गरिमन् m. Schwere, Würde, Macht.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "garisWa": [{"id": "garizWa", "headword": "गरिष्ठ", "headword_slp1": "garizWa", "fold": "garisWa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "capeller-sanskrit-german", "senses": [{"gloss": "गरिष्ठ u. ग॑रीयंस् Superl. u. Comparat. zu\nगुरु w. s.", "gloss_languag